te on a "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNVectorTileSource","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", toggling the appearance of countries in a vector tileset as they are tapped."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/FeatureStateVectorExample","role":"article","url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/featurestatevectorexample","title":"Set Feature State (Vector Source)","kind":"article"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNLineStyleLayer":{"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","title":"MLNLineStyleLayer","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is a style layer that renders one or more stroked"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"polylines on the map."}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre\/mlnlinestylelayer","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNLineStyleLayer","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"MLNLineStyleLayer","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS/AnimatedLineExample":{"kind":"article","type":"topic","title":"Animated Line","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre-Native-for-iOS\/AnimatedLineExample","role":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Add an animated line to a map","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre-native-for-ios\/animatedlineexample"},"https://opensource.foursquare.com/os-places/":{"type":"link","title":"Foursquare OS Places","url":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/","identifier":"https:\/\/opensource.foursquare.com\/os-places\/","titleInlineContent":[{"text":"Foursquare OS Places","type":"text"}]}}}